Files derived from xfig and fig2dev
-----------------------------------
Each file below carries a comment naming its sources and pointing to this
notice. xfig's sources are cited as src/..., fig2dev's as fig2dev/... (its
drivers as fig2dev/dev/...); app-defaults/Fig is xfig's resource file.
`cargo xtask licences` checks that this list and those comments agree.

